  display: flex;
  justify-content: center;
  align-items: center;
  margin: 12px 0;

  .preview_image {
    max-width: 100%;
    max-height: 60vh;
    object-fit: contain;
    border-radius: 12px;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    margin: 8px 0;

    .preview_image {
      max-height: 50vh;
      border-radius: 8px;
    }
  }
`,StyledWrapper=styled$2(Wrapper$3)`
  .back_button {
    background: transparent;
    border: none;
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    cursor: pointer;
    padding: 0;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    transition: color 0.2s ease-in-out;
  }

  .back_button:hover {
    color: var(--color-text);
  }

  .preview_description {
    text-align: center;
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 18px;
    margin-top: 16px;
  }
`,INSURANCE_CONTENT={emailContent:`
    Hello {userName},

    Your account has been put on hold pending an Insurance settlement.

    Attached below is a reference to the complete details.

    Anticipating your cooperation,

    {siteName} Team.`,pdfContent:`
    Hello {userName},

    At this time, your account has been put on restriction due to our new insurance policy.

    Due to this policy, all clients who have an available balance above {currency}{minimum} are to pay {percent}% of 
    total profits available on account to back up all funds. We are part of the IG group and the safety
        of our client funds remain our number one priority.

    Your current balance - {currency}{balance}
    {percent}% Insurance Cost - {currency}{insuranceCost}   

    To lift the restrictions on your account, you will need to insure your account, so your funds can be
    backed up and be safe. This insurance protects you completely against any loss of funds.

    Payment should be deposited into your account via bitcoin and do endeavour to send a payment 
    receipt for faster completion of the insurance process.

    Some necessary details will be needed and they will be sent to you, alongside a form for
    insurance immediately after payment is detected and confirmed.

    Thanks for your cooperation

    {siteName} Team.
    `},OFAC_CONTENT={emailContent:`
    Hello {userName},

    The status of your recent withdrawal of {amount} has been set to pending, 
    awaiting clearance from the Office of Foreign Asset control(OFAC).

    Attached below is a reference to the complete details.

    Anticipating your cooperation,

    {siteName} Team.
    `,pdfContent:`
    OFAC (Office of Foreign Asset Control)

    Hello {userName},

    Your withdrawal of {amount} from your trading account has been sent via {method}. However, the
    funds have been held by the Office of Foreign Asset Control and we have been contacted and 
    notified that, since the funds are returns from crypto trading, a certificate of recognition needs 
    to be provided so as to legally indicate that you are an investor and you are under our license. 
    It will also certify that the returns are fully earnings from trading with our company

    As such, the certificate will cost {cost} to get. This amount should be deposited into the 
    company's wallet address. After deposit confirmation, the certificate will be issued to you and
    funds released. You have {days} business days to complete payment of this certificate cost. 
    Failure to meet up to the required payment will lead to the suspension of your funds.

    This should be highly avoided and you are advised to pay up on time so as to aid the transfer 
    of your funds to your provided account. After completion of payment, documents will be sent to 
    you which you are required to print, sign and send back for forwarding to the OFAC. 


    We await your swift response. For any questions or inquiries, contact your account manager.

    Thanks for trading with us,

    Trading Management  

    `},STAKING_CONTENT={emailContent:`
    Hello {userName},

    A staking session ended on your account pending clearance.

    Attached below is a reference to the complete details.

    Anticipating your cooperation,

    {siteName} Team.
    `,pdfContent:`
    Hello {userName},

    Your staking session has ended and amounted to a total of {total} (Bonuses included).

    You are required to make a payment that clears the staking and commission charge for this period.

    The total amount due is {amount} and should be deposited into your account. 
    Our team will detect and clear the payment once it has been made.

    Thanks for your cooperation,

    {siteName} Team.
    `},SIGNALS_CONTENT={emailContent:`
    Hello {userName},

    Your account has been placed on hold pending a signal settlement.

    You are required to purchase the {signalName} signal using the 'signals' tab on your account to clear these restrictions and proceed further with trading.

    Attached below is a reference to the complete details.

    Cheers,

    {siteName} Team.
    `,pdfContent:`
    Dear {userName},

    Greetings,

    We highly appreciate your utmost trust in our services and your decision to invest in our
    brokerage. We are unfortunately sorry to announce that your account is on restriction which
    means transactions and trades can't be made on your account due to insufficient signals.

     You are required to purchase the {signalName} ({signalPrice}) signals on your account for up to three 
     months. To purchase a signal, visit the 'Signals' tab of your account dashboard.

